"Sorry ! In order to use WooCommerce %s Payment plugin, you need to install "
"and activate the WooCommerce plugin."
msgstr ""
"¡Lo sentimos! Para usar el plugin de pago %s WooCommerce, debe instalar y "
"activar el plugin WooCommerce."

msgid "This controls the title which the user sees during checkout."
msgstr "Esto controla el título que el usuario ve durante el pago."

